# HandyDandy needs no environment variables and no secrets.
# Configure it in your active profile's config.yaml under
# plugins.entries.handydandy.settings (see README "Settings").
#
# Deprecated: HANDYDANDY_<KEY> environment variables from 0.4.0 and earlier are
# still read when the matching config setting is missing, with one warning.
# Move them into config.yaml; the fallback will be removed in a later release.
